-- 1090: Blog post — "From Our Classroom to the App Store: How a Learner Built LeanerTogether with Claude Code"
--       Case study on Tan Chin Hock, featured in The Straits Times (23 Aug 2026), who attended
--       WSQ - Agentic AI Applications with Claude Code (TGS-2025052468) on 30 May 2026 and began
--       building his calorie-tracking app LeanerTogether on 1 June 2026.
--
-- Notes for future editors:
--  * apply.php splits statements on ";" at end-of-line — the content HTML below is
--    intentionally ONE line. Do not reformat it.
